OL,3,AUK-Iranian dual national arrested over
OL,4,ARAF Fairford released on bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UK-Iranian dual national arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of preparation of terrorist
OL,8,Facts in connection with an incident at
OL,9,FRAF Fairford has been released on bail.
OL,11,FThe 25-year-old man was arrested in the
OL,12,FLondon borough of Westminster on
OL,13,FThursday. Searches of two properties in
OL,14,Fthe same area have now finished.
OL,16,FA major incident was declared and
OL,17,Fdozens of homes were evacuated after
OL,18,Fpolice were alerted to three
OL,19,F"suspicious vehicles" near the airbase
OL,20,Fin Gloucestershire last weekend.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
