OL,3,AUK-Iranian dual national arrested over
OL,4,ARAF Fairford released on bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive other men in their twenties were
OL,7,Farrested and were subsequently released
OL,8,Fon police bail. All five were UK
OL,9,Fnationals from London.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
