OL,3,ARussia hits second major bridge in
OL,4,AUkraine's capital Kyiv
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia said its drones had hit the two
OL,7,Fbridges used to transfer Ukrainian
OL,8,Ftroops and military cargo. Moscow again
OL,9,Furged foreign citizens, including
OL,10,Fdiplomats, to leave Kyiv.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
