OL,3,A'Anger in the streets': Tens of
OL,4,Athousands protest in Spain over housing
OL,5,Acrisis
OL,6,
OL,7,F"There is a lot of anger in the
OL,8,Fstreets," said a spokesperson for the
OL,9,FValencia Tenants' Union, where a
OL,10,Fdemonstration has already started.
OL,11,FClashes have taken place between some
OL,12,Fprotesters and police in the city.
OL,14,FThe measures put forward by Pedro
OL,15,FSanchez's leftist coalition government
OL,16,Fon Friday followed public outcry over
OL,17,Fthe eviction of an 87-year-old woman
OL,18,Ffrom her home last month after she was
OL,19,Funable to afford a sharp rent increase.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
